~ start
set voice_pitch = 0.5
if not cop_encountered
	=> first_encounter
	
if not cop_fed
	if has_donuts
		=> receive_donuts
	else
		Tricericop: I knew I should've gotten breakfast instead of stopping those crimes...
else
	Tricericop: Just give me a few minutes to digest...
=> END

~ first_encounter
Tricericop: *Breathing heavily*
Tricericop: [wave]You there...[/wave]
if not player_clothed:
	Tricericop: Dino who, if I could see right now, I'm certain would be wearing clothes...
Tricericop: I need your help. It's an emergency.
Tricericop: I need you to get me...
Tricericop: [wave]A donut.[/wave]
Tricericop: I'm so hungry I couldn't even make it to the station!
Tricericop: My favorite cafe is right there on the other side of the museum...
Tricericop: Please... the fate of the city depends on it...
set cop_encountered = true
=> END

~ receive_donuts
Tricericop: Oh, thank god, donuts! Sweet, delicious donuts.
Tricericop: *Horrible devouring sounds*
Tricericop: Mmmf... fank you fo mupch...
Tricericop: *swallows* 
Tricericop: Here, take this. It's a old pocketwatch I found in the paddy wagon after arresting some hooligan earlier.
Tricericop: Might be worth something!
set cop_fed = true
set has_bribe = true
do reveal_item("Watch")
do remove_item("Donuts")
=> END